								{
									"type": "text",
									"text": "Docker run command is used to run a container from an image. Running the docker run nginx command will run an instance of the nginx application on the docker host if it already exist. if the image is not present on the host, it will go out to docker hub and pull that image down. But this is only done the first time. For subsequent executions the same image will be reused. Docker hub limits pull "
